  * the system prompt preamble "You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI
    for Claude" (prompt caching and behaviour tuning key off that exact text);
  * the "claude-code/<version>" User-Agent;
  * the OpenTelemetry service.name "claude-code";
  * the CLAUDE.md / CLAUDE.local.md / AGENTS.md memory filenames (a shared
    cross-tool ecosystem convention);
  * the CLAUDECODE=1 child-process environment variable (cross-tool hints
    protocol).

